== Trivia ==
*The '''Rogue Sword''' used to be the weakest sword with an item ability. Now, that spot is held by the {{Item|Aspect of the Jerry}}.
*The '''Rogue Sword''' used to be obtained through {{NPCSprite|Jamie}}, a guide villager in the {{Zone|Hub}}.
**There was a glitch where sometimes the player wouldn't receive the '''Rogue Sword''' from {{NPCSprite|Jamie}}.

